sentences.text:
This Transfer Petition is filed under Section 25 of the Code of Civil Procedure, 1908 (for short CPC) by the petitioner-wife as against the respondent-husband, seeking the following prayers:
(a) Transfer the Petition being Petition A. No.223 of 2021 filed by the Respondent before the Family Court, Sangli, Maharashtra, under Section 13(1) (i- a)(i-b) of the Hindu Marriage Act for getting Divorce Decree to the Court of Family Judge, Vadodara;
AND (b) Pass such other or further order(s) as this Honble Court may deem fit and proper in the facts and circumstances of the case and for the ends of justice.
